  <item>
    <title>Vol.115 奇了怪！刚吃进嘴里，就想起了你！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6b0079d177e5b18a33306c74</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6b0079d177e5b18a33306c74</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>妈妈的炒蛋与初恋炒的牛肉，</span></p><p><span>还有那碗多加肉的皮蛋瘦肉粥，</span></p><p><span>都藏着味觉与情感的化学反应。</span></p><p><span>本期节目，我们一起聊聊，人生中有哪些美食会让你再次吃到的时候，会开启记忆的大门，让你每一次咀嚼都在重温那些离散的人与事</span></p><p></p><p><span>【本期Timeline】</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="99">00:01:39</a> 短视频里吃到妈妈菜的人瞬间泪奔</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="143">00:02:23</a> 妈妈的辣椒炒蛋秘诀：加入料酒</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="467">00:07:47</a> 辣椒酱里加苹果，独门秘方！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="612">00:10:12</a> 卤肉饭挑战：无人能敌的自信！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="753">00:12:33</a> 泡椒芹菜炒牛肉，勾起对初恋的回忆</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1269">00:21:09</a> 上海炸猪排，蘸辣酱油更带劲</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2159">00:35:59</a> 卤肉饭和绿豆汤让朋友想起我</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2498">00:41:38</a> 朋友之间的杨桃「承诺」，记仇技能满点！</span></p><p><span>————</span></p><p><span>主播：阿有&amp;水哥</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lrubTzBeDlOkhxwm_h0WbDvOTa1g.png"><p></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/66ead1845ca6d0ace3c35b31/lgxDgqq7OCnEZFtepNSwJpbVzywK.m4a" length="43781394" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:45:07</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjZ_HezlLCYE8HC_MlM92mz96LvW.jpg"/>
