  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.114 爽！致伤害我的人：我凭什么放过你！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6af4a8d63caef3b52f546132</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6af4a8d63caef3b52f546132</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 16:01:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>有时候，较真不是我们脾气太冲，是有些人实在太没分寸。</span><br><br><span>我们总被劝着遇事要息事宁人多一事不如少一事，但真当自己的家人朋友平白受了委屈，那些憋在心里的火气根本压不住。</span><br><br><span>就像你放狠话要让对方余生不得安宁，其实根本没想做什么极端的事，只是想让那些躲在暗处搞小动作的人赶紧收手，别再欺负老实人。</span><br><br><span>那些看似很凶的对峙，其实是我们护住身边人的铠甲。</span><br><br><span>【本期Timeline】</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="256">00:04:16</a> 老爸老妈坚持晒衣服，烘干机都快退休啦</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="410">00:06:50</a> 楼上楼下邻居齐聚街头，骂声震天</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="524">00:08:44</a> 楼上邻居因报警威胁主动道歉</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1197">00:19:57</a> 妈妈是小区明星，走到哪都有人打招呼</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1639">00:27:19</a> 周围人多货杂，十分钟后神秘消失，是谁？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2111">00:35:11</a> 小偷只拿零钱，却放过了数码相机</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2229">00:37:09</a> 老板娘报警未追责，给涉事员工留机会</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2670">00:44:30</a> 「听我们节目的人定有好运，贱人都绕道」</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2767">00:46:07</a> 谁都是宝贝，没必要为了烂人委屈自己</span><br></p><p><span>——</span></p><p><span>主播：阿有 &amp; 水哥</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lrb-XuzTiTTWD-bwtRhVY4ykNqud.png"><p></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/66ead1845ca6d0ace3c35b31/lih3uEuWDvkvfX-VWFnsJlM4tHY3.m4a" length="44855383" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:46:13</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjZ_HezlLCYE8HC_MlM92mz96LvW.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.113 争当「纯过日子人」，不攀比了！不烧心了！不内耗了！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6aef2d5e5b7c4709bfe2900a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6aef2d5e5b7c4709bfe2900a</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>精打细算 vs 冲动消费，你属于哪一类？</span></p><p><span>你觉得自己是一个纯过日子人吗？</span></p><p><span>本期节目，两位主播各站一边，讨论一下会过日子和不会过日子两种人，都有哪些趣事</span></p><p><span>【本期Timeline】</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="75">01:15</a> 购物哲学大对决：精打细算VS眼睛都不眨</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="384">06:24</a> 成功要回差价，真是购物小确幸！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="563">09:23</a> 双十一不囤货，除非刚好需要</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="769">12:49</a> 一餐饭三个地方买，吃到更好品质</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1132">18:52</a> 露台种植让一家人水果够吃一周！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2072">34:32</a> 通过闲鱼订酒店省了300块</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2651">44:11</a> 灵机一动，用海鲜市场app找停车位</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3451">57:31</a> 花钱精明，省小钱让人有成就感！</span></p><p><span>—————</span></p><p><span>主播：阿有&amp;水哥</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lrubTzBeDlOkhxwm_h0WbDvOTa1g.png"></figure>]]></description>
