    <pubDate>Sun, 25 Oct 2026 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>假期刚过不久，本期两位主播一起分享关于假期经历的一些搞笑时刻</span></p><p><span>【本期Timeline】</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="171">00:02:51</a> 清远长隆体验：动物界的豪华游</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="296">00:04:56</a> 母亲多年不吃鸡，清远鸡让她破例</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="514">00:08:34</a> 妈妈自责一晚上，迷信与科学拉扯</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="645">00:10:45</a> 海底捞生日惊喜：妈妈和对象坐一起</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="835">00:13:55</a> 我爸为确认鸡性别，与厨师对话</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1014">00:16:54</a> 广东全吃公鸡？母鸡呢？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1484">00:24:44</a> 国庆七天无休，打工人的辛酸泪</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2302">00:38:22</a> 帅哥拍照三分钟，女生却享半小时</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2729">00:45:29</a> 叫你「哥哥」，你会给微信吗？</span></p><p><span>————————</span></p><p><span>本期主播：阿有&amp;水哥</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lrubTzBeDlOkhxwm_h0WbDvOTa1g.png"></figure><p></p>]]></description>
