  <item>
    <title>Vol.110 城市和乡镇小孩的童年，好像不一样？！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6ad3a02f0e4e410a05be6613</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6ad3a02f0e4e410a05be6613</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 16:01:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>成长环境不一样，连童年的模样，都会长出完全不同的枝桠。</span><br><br><span>我们都拥有过闪闪发光的童年，可同样是小时候，城市里的小区滑梯、小区池塘，和乡村的田埂小溪、稻草堆，竟然能差出这么多不一样的故事。</span><br><br><span>你在幼儿园乖乖等爸妈接，我自己背着书包走回家；你在标准泳池学游泳，我在河里捡个轮胎内胎当游泳圈；你周末上兴趣班学打字，我周末去田埂钓青蛙躺草堆。那些不一样的细碎小事，凑起来就是独属于我们的独家记忆。</span><br><br><span>那些刻在不同土壤里的童年印记，不管时隔多久，想起来都还带着当时的温度。</span><br><br><span>【本期Timeline】</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="86">01:26</a> 你玩过用五块小石子游戏吗？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="407">06:47</a> 入园还要自己搬桌子去？至今都忘不掉</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="820">13:40</a> 户外野游哪有标准泳姿，狗爬式才是王道</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="982">16:22</a> 你听过专属于过去的「农忙假」吗？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1371">22:51</a> 到现在都忘不了五笔字根表</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1478">24:38</a> 绑个萝卜干就能钓青蛙</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1787">29:47</a> 童年躺稻草堆，现在只能躺男人身上</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1918">31:58</a> 小时候不爱玩具枪，偏偏就想学绣花</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2475">41:15</a> 疯打热线找鞠萍姐姐，结果被一顿收拾</span></p><p><span>————</span></p><p><span>主播：阿有 &amp; 水哥</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lrb-XuzTiTTWD-bwtRhVY4ykNqud.png"><p></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/66ead1845ca6d0ace3c35b31/lnD2OfTl1JqmUE0U2AswBwEZwlFQ.m4a" length="53570490" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:55:12</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjZ_HezlLCYE8HC_MlM92mz96LvW.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.109 爆笑审美进化史：吊裆裤里藏着谁的青春？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6aca4ab4195d838e2aefe33e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6aca4ab4195d838e2aefe33e</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>从「土」到「潮」，从美特斯邦威到优衣库，从背头到莫西干头，你是否也经历过自身关于时尚的蜕变？</span></p><p><span>本期与主播一起聊聊关于普通男孩的时尚进化，谈谈经历过的品牌记忆与消费变迁：</span></p><p><span>【本期Timeline】</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="55">00:55</a> 从「土」到「时尚」的进化秘籍？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="106">01:46</a> 衣服穿人还是人穿衣？有人天赋异禀！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="217">03:37</a> 以为发型不错，结果大家都说太丑</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="388">06:28</a> 中学生也为潮流拼命！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="460">07:40</a> 裤脚宽到拖地，时尚真是个轮回！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="959">15:59</a> 穿上美特斯邦威，能吹牛一整年！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1064">17:44</a> 白天鹅骑车遇险，结局让人忍俊不禁</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1287">21:27</a> 不再迷恋贵牌，优衣库让我时尚无敌</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1558">25:58</a> 辛苦一年，买了件700块的杰克琼斯</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1623">27:03</a> 年轻时过圣诞节：省生活费买衣服</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1767">29:27</a> 有情饮水饱的节日经济学。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2810">46:50</a> 吃也是时尚，山姆购物成新潮流！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3683">01:01:23</a> 未来老年时尚：电动轮椅成时尚单品</span></p><p><span>————</span></p><p><span>主播：阿有&amp;水哥</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lrubTzBeDlOkhxwm_h0WbDvOTa1g.png"></figure><p></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/66ead1845ca6d0ace3c35b31/lgHx7_yPTpyyM3sD-wPTgV4H4fEo.m4a" length="61780052" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:03:40</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjZ_HezlLCYE8HC_MlM92mz96LvW.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.108 猪妖、猪精大PK，流连人间只为偷摸吃喝！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6ab8df81195d838e2aea9bbe</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6ab8df81195d838e2aea9bbe</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 27 Sep 2026 16:01:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>长大以后我们总在说要克制食欲，却忘了小时候那种控制不住嘴馋的时刻，有多鲜活动人。</span><br><br><span>我们太习惯告诉自己要少吃点、要控糖控盐，可人生里最有意思的回忆，常常来自那一口「我就是忍不住」的馋。</span><br><br><span>比如为了最后一颗脆甜水蜜桃忍不住咬一大口，蹲在邻居家盯着泡盐水的菠萝迈不动脚，趁妈妈做饭偷偷干掉一整挂香蕉，甚至翻出柜子里过期好几年的藕粉做成Q弹的钵仔糕。每一件事听起来都有点好笑，却全都是小时候最纯粹的快乐。</span><br><br><span>那一点点控制不住的小馋瘾，是我们写给平淡生活的小情诗。</span><br></p><p><br><span>【本期Timeline】</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="66">01:06</a> 「我们如实告诉大家吧，我们不是人类，而是……」</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="398">06:38</a> 妹妹的桃子被咬一口，哭出家庭小「地震」</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="526">08:46</a> 一口气干掉一整挂香蕉，妈妈惊呆了</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="868">14:28</a> 根本停不下来，辣味美食的魔力太强大</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1084">18:04</a> 阿姨夹一块菠萝给我，开心得像中了头奖</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1219">20:19</a> 邻家独特吃法：剥龙眼配辣椒，无辣不欢</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1368">22:48</a> 学生用香蕉整蛊老师，香蕉变大便，笑料十足</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2033">33:53</a> 小时候像「大老鼠」一样，偷吃外婆藏的京味麦片</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2463">41:03</a> 试过那么多月饼，我只真爱椰蓉口味</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2577">42:57</a> 月饼里放猪腰？这创新谁能敢尝试啊！</span></p><p><span>——</span></p><p><span>主播：阿有 &amp; 水哥</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lrb-XuzTiTTWD-bwtRhVY4ykNqud.png"><p></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/66ead1845ca6d0ace3c35b31/lpSMu4wtz7UrXOAfURwo_JxmWMwA.m4a" length="42505715" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:43:48</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjZ_HezlLCYE8HC_MlM92mz96LvW.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.107 是不是我越「不在乎」，就越「自由」？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6aad18f0051af796b9ea3a5c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6aad18f0051af796b9ea3a5c</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 20 Sep 2026 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>有什么事情，是自己以前很在乎，后来便慢慢不太在意的？</span></p><p><span>是旅游从热衷打卡赶行程到偏爱松弛休闲？</span></p><p><span>或者从为虚荣心追逐到只在乎自身感受？</span></p><p><span>亦或是从执着追问真相到接纳成长懂得筛选？</span></p><p><span>今天和主播一起聊聊，关于那些慢慢不太在乎的事情</span></p><p><span>【本期Timeline】</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="86">01:26</a> 看到大家DIY T恤充满热情，自己却没了当初的兴致，感叹岁月的神奇</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="148">02:28</a> 旅行观念转变：以前必打卡地标，现在随性而行更轻松</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="408">06:48</a> 云南旅行偏好：一个地方待四五天，深度体验才是王道</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="531">08:51</a> 对待纪念日心态转变：过去疯狂准备，现在觉得可有可无，是成长的标志</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="597">09:57</a> 期待值太高会放大情绪落差，心情就像坐过山车</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="928">15:28</a> 新鲜感消失后，节日成了时间消磨剂，快乐变得麻木</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1051">17:31</a> 消费观念转变：过去追求名牌logo，如今更注重个人感受</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1120">18:40</a> 穿衣不再为别人眼光，而是为自己舒服，终于告别「logo展示会」</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1487">24:47</a> 为了logo买奢侈包，挤地铁心疼、颜色不爱也没关系，就是虚荣心作祟</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1678">27:58</a> 按自己的想法生活，别人的评价随风去，做自己最重要</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1766">29:26</a> 成长就是从在意所有人的眼光，变成只在意重要的人，变化太神奇</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2026">33:46</a> 小时候在意他人评价，长大了觉得评头论足的旁观者很可笑</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2190">36:30</a> 处理友情的心态转变：从非要刨根问底问真相，到靠自己判断从容处理</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2466">41:06</a> 越来越看淡很多事不是变得冷漠，反而更珍惜曾经在乎的事物，成长真的很有趣</span></p><p></p><p><span>————</span></p><p><span>主播：阿有&amp;水哥</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lrubTzBeDlOkhxwm_h0WbDvOTa1g.png"><p></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/66ead1845ca6d0ace3c35b31/lukeJFhh73pGG2jrv7PI5cOQ1oEp.m4a" length="40639715" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:41:52</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjZ_HezlLCYE8HC_MlM92mz96LvW.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.106 抓马故事千千万，好友情史占一半！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6aa5772f492687f6aad8e9b1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6aa5772f492687f6aad8e9b1</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 13 Sep 2026 16:01:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>我们太习惯听播客一定要有什么干货收获，可最放松的时刻，常常来自于没目的瞎唠，听一点离自己不远又足够抓马的八卦。</span><br><br><span>比如今天这期，四个故事藏真假，整个聊天像拆盲盒一样，起起伏伏，足够狗血，足够过瘾。</span><br><br><span>有时候不用带什么目的听节目，瞎唠八卦的快乐，本来就是治愈生活疲惫的解药。</span><br><br><span>【本期Timeline】</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="56">00:56</a> 朋友的精彩人生，匿名分享</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="180">03:00</a> 前一秒甜如蜜，下一秒哭着说男友不爱他</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="334">05:34</a> 新男友眼熟，朋友神秘说「眼熟本来就该啊」</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="494">08:14</a> 豪宅约饭开门撞见前任</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="636">10:36</a> 旧情复燃还送了房</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1114">18:34</a> 帮朋友打印通话记录，揪出可疑号码</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1341">22:21</a> 妻子层层抽丝剥茧，丈夫直接承认出轨</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1384">23:04</a> 小三怀孕上门，态度嚣张到让人想扇巴掌</span></p><p><span>——</span></p><p><span>主播：阿有&amp;水哥</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lrb-XuzTiTTWD-bwtRhVY4ykNqud.png"><p></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/66ead1845ca6d0ace3c35b31/lj_6FOiVFH9utO0yyC0ys2ncxx71.m4a" length="49361606" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:50:52</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjZ_HezlLCYE8HC_MlM92mz96LvW.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.105 &quot;前任遗物&quot;是纪念品？还是眼中钉？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a9bd4a9a0210c197dcddd4a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a9bd4a9a0210c197dcddd4a</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 06 Sep 2026 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>你家里是否还有前任遗物？</span></p><p><span>分手后的前任遗物应该怎么处理？扔掉还是保留？</span></p><p><span>本期节目，一起进行“前任遗物”大盘点</span></p><p></p><p><span>【本期Timeline】</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="189">00:03:09</a> 分手后要回笔记本电脑：爱情账单的幽默争议</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="337">00:05:37</a> 护肤品融入皮肉：无法归还的「情感消耗品」</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="817">00:13:37</a> 果断搬家：丢弃回忆的干净利落</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="911">00:15:11</a> 手机里的前任照片：删不掉的数字幽灵</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1345">00:22:25</a> 社交媒体推前任：惊讶发现他们大变样</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1753">00:29:13</a> 猫咪的「创意」排泄：分手后宠物引发的灾难</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1885">00:31:25</a> 狗的抚养权争论：分手后的「孩子」归属</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2152">00:35:52</a> 拉黑前任：心理监狱的自我救赎</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2515">00:41:55</a> 看到旧照片开心：但不让情绪回到过去</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2741">00:45:41</a> 剃须刀陪伴十多年：前任物品的情感见证</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3707">01:01:47</a> 闲鱼上的前任礼物：分手后的二手市场火爆</span></p><p><span>————</span></p><p><span>主播：阿有&amp;水哥</span></p><p><span>嘉宾：棒棒</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lrubTzBeDlOkhxwm_h0WbDvOTa1g.png"></figure>]]></description>
