    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>一起聊聊成人世界的“场面戏”哲学，假装赞美如何拯救我们的社交与生活？</span></p><p></p><p><span>【本期Timeline】</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="161">00:02:41</a> 职场小技巧：有时真诚不如演技重要</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="214">00:03:34</a> 情侣化解冷场小妙招</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="386">00:06:26</a> 试图打破沉默，内心脚趾抠地疯狂找话题</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="529">00:08:49</a> 社交趣事：旅途中遇到全程隐身的朋友</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1025">00:17:05</a> 买皮肤理念：不为赢只为好看</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1344">00:22:24</a> 夸奖的魔力：一句话让对方态度从傲慢秒变友好</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1870">00:31:10</a> 家庭场面戏：妈妈剧透电视剧，儿子假装有兴趣</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1915">00:31:55</a> 家庭厨艺趣事：爸爸每天试新菜谱</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2130">00:35:30</a> 家庭相处智慧：和长辈演点场面戏，别啥都直说</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2344">00:39:04</a> 撒娇实战：水哥撒娇说手痛，成功躲过洗碗任务</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2514">00:41:54</a> 职场撒娇趣事：女同事撒娇邀拼单咖啡</span></p><p><span>——————</span></p><p><span>主播：阿有&amp;水哥</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lrubTzBeDlOkhxwm_h0WbDvOTa1g.png"><p></p>]]></description>
