  <item>
    <title>Vol.102 男顶流养成记：最大的烦恼是「太红了」！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a81dca817676351c572cc5f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a81dca817676351c572cc5f</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 16 Aug 2026 16:41:42 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fgy-XwXOlR0NETdjMq-WwR0GdOSI.png"><p><span>我们太习惯人生一定要「按计划走」，但偶尔放空做一场不切实际的梦，反而能给紧绷的生活松松绑。</span><br><br><span>比如这一场成为男顶流的幻想，从街头被星探发掘，到熬住六年蛰伏的低谷，再到顶住舆论逆风翻盘，整个幻想天马行空，却爽得格外尽兴。</span><br><br><span>有些不切实际的白日梦，是我们给平凡日常开的透气口。</span><br><br><span>【本期Timeline】</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="206">03:26</a> 今天的白日梦：幻想成为男顶流明星</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="262">04:22</a> 顶流的烦恼：红了怕被翻黑历史</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="939">15:39</a> 上厕所偶遇大明星，意外拿到签约资格！</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1109">18:29</a> 被合同绑死，辞职要赔5000万港币，</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1467">24:27</a> 跑龙套连便当都混不上，新人太心酸</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1910">31:50</a> 娱乐圈社交场像迷宫一样猜不透</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2180">36:20</a> 新古装剧筹拍，剧名居然叫《贾嬛传》</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2432">40:32</a> 单代言就赚5亿，签完约仓库货直接被抢空</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2528">42:08</a> 私生活曝光，顶流身份被发现是gay</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3010">50:10</a> 「不一定要当大明星，精彩生活才是王道」</span></p><p><span>——</span></p><p><span>主播：阿有 &amp; 水哥</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lrb-XuzTiTTWD-bwtRhVY4ykNqud.png"><p></p>]]></description>
